  "topic": "navigation",
  "subtopic": "deduced_types",
  "title": "`auto` behind pointers and references",
  "summary": "Pointers, references and arrays around the deduced type are stripped: `auto*`, `const auto&`, `auto&&`, `decltype(auto)` and an `auto` deduced as a pointer all reach the class",
  "prose": "The `auto` of a structured binding reaches the type of the object it\ndecomposes.",
  "status": "supported",
  "issues": [
    "clangd#2055"
  ],
